e potential for a fully concealed hand (4 points). My Bamboo tiles (B3, B4, B5, B6) form the core of a promising structure, with B3 and B4 having excellent availability (4 copies each remaining). Maintaining concealment preserves flexibility and higher scoring potential.\n\nAnswer: Pass"}
